claude 2.1.273 (Claude Code)

The terminal `result` line from the same `--permission-prompt-tool stdio`
run as `ask-allow-response.jsonl`, trimmed to the fields `signal` and
`parse_run_output` read. Proves a `result` line, not just any JSON line,
ends the conversation — the CLI keeps running past it with stdin open, and
only closing stdin (which `Finished` triggers) lets it exit.
